  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I made it so the Phys bone component in my tail gets disabled when pulled past a certain point, but when pulled past that point the tail seems to reset but keeps the length added by the stretching while the 2nd person holding the tail still has it \"held\". When the 2nd person lets go of their grip it looks like it returns to normal; but when grabbed again it seems to stretch again but this time in an order of magnitude each time its performed.\nIts really hard to describe so I uploaded a video of it from their point\nhttps://streamable.com/lakyci",
